/P 129 0 R
/E (All participants are expected to maintain respectful and professional behavior throughout the competition. Harassment, discrimination, or disruptive conduct will not be tolerated. Teams must refrain from using inappropriate language, images, or content in their submissions or presentations. All communication with event organizers, judges, and other participants must be conducted in a polite and respectful manner. Teams must respect time limits and adhere to schedules provided by the organizing committee.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
