/E (At the UTSRI, we are committed to fostering and maintaining a diverse, equitable and inclusive environment across all of our events. We believe this is crucial in creating a culture of respect, innovation and collaboration. By joining UTSRI events, you are contributing to a community built on mutual respect and inclusivity. Thank you for upholding these values and ensuring that all participants can engage in a safe, supportive, and enriching environment. If you experience or witness any violations of this policy, please report them to an event organizer or designated contact for further action. )
